## 📡 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/problems/create` | Create a new problem |
| `GET` | `/api/problems/list` | List all problems |
| `GET` | `/api/problems/{id}` | Get single problem |
| `DELETE` | `/api/problems/{id}` | Delete problem |
| `POST` | `/api/swarm/start` | Start a simulation |
| `GET` | `/api/swarm/status/{sim_id}` | Get live status |
| `POST` | `/api/swarm/pause/{sim_id}` | Pause simulation |
| `POST` | `/api/swarm/stop/{sim_id}` | Stop simulation |
| `GET` | `/api/swarm/result/{sim_id}` | Get final result |
| `GET` | `/api/ai/explain/{sim_id}` | Get AI explanation |
| `WS` | `/ws/simulation/{sim_id}` | Live WebSocket stream |

