🎯 Ye .gitignore Kyun Important Hai
Section	Kyun Zaroori Hai
🔐 Secrets (.env)	API keys kabhi upload nahi honi chahiye — security risk
🐍 Python	__pycache__, venv/ — bahut bhaari aur useless
🗄️ Database	swarm.db auto-generate hoti hai, upload nahi karni
🟢 Node	node_modules/ — 50,000+ files, upload karna paagalpan hai
💻 IDE	.vscode/, .idea/ — personal settings
🖥️ OS	.DS_Store, Thumbs.db — OS specific junk
