📝 SwarmMind — Complete README.md File
Bhai, yahan complete README.md de raha hun. Ye copy-paste kar do apni project folder me README.md file me. Interviewer pe solid impression padega.

🎯 Kaise Use Karna Hai
Apne project folder me jao: C:\Users\HP\ai-swarm-intelligence-platform

README.md file kholo (VS Code me ya Notepad me)

Poora purana content delete kar do (Ctrl+A → Delete)

Neeche wala pura content copy-paste karo

