- 🚑 **Emergency Response** — Disaster relief allocation
- 🏭 **Manufacturing** — Job scheduling on factory floors
- 🌐 **Network Routing** — Internet packet optimization
- 🧬 **Bioinformatics** — Protein folding, gene sequencing
- 📡 **Telecom** — Antenna placement, frequency assignment

