- **Multi-objective optimization** (time + cost + carbon)
- **Reinforcement learning integration** for adaptive parameters
- **Distributed swarm across multiple machines** (true parallelism)
- **3D visualization** with Three.js
- **Mobile app** for on-the-go simulations
- **Cloud deployment** with Kubernetes scaling

