## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites
- Python 3.10 or higher
- Node.js 18 or higher
- Git

### 🔧 Backend Setup

```bash
# Navigate to backend
cd backend

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# Activate (Windows)
venv\Scripts\activate

# Activate (Mac/Linux)
source venv/bin/activate
